  "changes": [
    "Unified namespace and project name as Decision2Care.",
    "Filesystem paths and historical run replay replaced by injected prepared inputs.",
    "Medication and procedure selection decision methods retained.",
    "ICD-9 crosswalk loading optional; not used for ICD-10 inference.",
    "Pinned model checked on every uncached response.",
    "Forecast task prompts extracted verbatim; generic runner supports eight ED8h disease presets.",
    "No patient records, fixed patient lists, provider credentials, caches, or experiment results included.",
    "Independent release audit restored the copy import used by the production prognosis response handler.",
    "Unused optional dialogue-start helpers removed; the supported record-history renderer is retained.",
    "Production HTTP and SDK adapters verified with mock transports without provider calls."
  ],
